  },
  {
    "id": 4901100160030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、部屋に置いといたら、\r\nお月さんの出とらん夜でも寂しくなかよ～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110016/4901100160030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……\r\nそれになんだか、部屋がおしゃれになる気がするな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "月の形のランプか……\r\n眺めてたら、恋鐘のことを思い出しそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100160040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110016/4901100160040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100160050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "本当は……そがん風になったらよかって思って、\r\nこい、選んだとよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110016/4901100160050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100160060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、はっきり言われてしまうと……\r\nなんやろ、うち……ばり恥ずかしか～！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110016/4901100160060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？\r\nでも、返さないぞ、もらっちゃったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100160070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサー！\r\nうち、そがんこと言うとらんばい～！！",
